msgid "* Error alerts during installation generally do not prevent the program from working correctly."
msgstr ""
"* Upozorenja o pogreškama tijekom instalacije obično ne sprječavaju ispravno funkcioniranje "
"programa."
msgid "Read before proceeding with the installation:"
msgstr "Pročitajte prije nego što nastavite s instalacijom:"
msgid ""
"Prefer native packages, built for BigLinux, Manjaro, Arch, or other Linux systems compatible with "
"the <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"Another option is to use programs made for any Linux system, usually in <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.run</span>, <span color='#CC2222'>.appimage</span>, or <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.flatpak</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"If the program is not available in the formats above, the <span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> file "
"can be converted to <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> and installed on this system. However, "
"the installation may not work correctly."
msgstr ""
"Preferirajte izvorne pakete, izgrađene za BigLinux, Manjaro, Arch ili druge Linux sustave "
"kompatibilne s <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> formatom.\n"
"\n"
"Druga opcija je korištenje programa napravljenih za bilo koji Linux sustav, obično u <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.run</span>, <span color='#CC2222'>.appimage</span> ili <span "
"color='#CC2222'>.flatpak</span> formatu.\n"
"\n"
"Ako program nije dostupan u gornjim formatima, <span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> datoteka može se "
"pretvoriti u <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> i instalirati na ovom sustavu. Međutim, "
"instalacija možda neće ispravno raditi."
msgid ""
"<big>This system uses the <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> package format, but the file is in "
"<span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> format.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to proceed with the installation?</big>\n"
msgstr ""
"<big>Ovaj sustav koristi <span color='#CC2222'>.pkg.tar</span> paket format, ali je datoteka u "
"<span color='#CC2222'>.deb</span> formatu.\n"
"\n"
"Želite li nastaviti s instalacijom?</big>"
msgid "Install & Review Config Files"
msgstr "Instaliraj i pregledaj konfiguracijske datoteke"
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instaliraj"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Zatvori"
msgid "Install .deb package"
msgstr "Instalirajte .deb paket"
msgid "Converting file, please wait. This may take a few minutes..."
msgstr "Pretvaranje datoteke, molimo pričekajte. Ovo može potrajati nekoliko minuta..."
msgid "Done!"
msgstr "Završeno!"
